# TypeScript emit that lands next to the sources.
#
# `apps/workers` currently imports straight out of `apps/api/src/**` while
# declaring `"rootDir": "src"` of its own, so `tsc` resolves those files as
# workers sources and writes the compiled output beside the original .ts
# instead of into dist/. A single `pnpm build` leaves ~776 stray files here.
#
# Ignoring them stops the artifacts being committed by accident. It does not
# fix the underlying rootDir problem — that lives in apps/workers/tsconfig.json.
src/**/*.js
src/**/*.js.map
src/**/*.d.ts
src/**/*.d.ts.map
